#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:87
msgid "<0>1-Click Cancellation:</0> You can cancel your subscription at any time directly within the Ataqu Admin settings. You do not need to call us, email us, or speak to a \"retention specialist.\""
msgstr "<0>1-Click Cancellation:</0> You can cancel your subscription at any time directly within the Ataqu Admin settings. You do not need to call us, email us, or speak to a \"retention specialist.\""

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:46
msgid "<0>A. Account Data:</0> Email address, company name, and hashed password (if not using SSO via Google/Microsoft)."
msgstr "<0>A. Account Data:</0> Email address, company name, and hashed password (if not using SSO via Google/Microsoft)."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:193
msgid "<0>Active Accounts:</0> Your data is retained as long as your account is active."
msgstr "<0>Active Accounts:</0> Your data is retained as long as your account is active."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:117
msgid "<0>Ataqu explicitly prohibits the use of Customer Data for training artificial intelligence.</0>"
msgstr "<0>Ataqu explicitly prohibits the use of Customer Data for training artificial intelligence.</0>"

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:160
msgid "<0>Ataqu IP:</0> We own the Ataqu software, the Rust codebase, the UI design, and the \"Ataqu\" brand. You do not gain any ownership rights by using the Service."
msgstr "<0>Ataqu IP:</0> We own the Ataqu software, the Rust codebase, the UI design, and the \"Ataqu\" brand. You do not gain any ownership rights by using the Service."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:52
msgid "<0>B. Billing Data:</0> Credit card number, expiration date, and billing address. Payment processing is strictly handled by our PCI‑DSS compliant payment processor (e.g., Stripe). We never store your full credit card number on our servers."
msgstr "<0>B. Billing Data:</0> Credit card number, expiration date, and billing address. Payment processing is strictly handled by our PCI‑DSS compliant payment processor (e.g., Stripe). We never store your full credit card number on our servers."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:61
msgid "<0>C. Customer Data:</0> The business information you actively input into the apps (e.g., deals in CINQ, messages in DIAL, docs in PIVOT)."
msgstr "<0>C. Customer Data:</0> The business information you actively input into the apps (e.g., deals in CINQ, messages in DIAL, docs in PIVOT)."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:199
msgid "<0>Canceled Accounts:</0> Upon account cancellation, your data remains accessible for export for 7 days. After 30 days, all Customer Data is permanently and irreversibly deleted from the primary PostgreSQL databases and all backups."
msgstr "<0>Canceled Accounts:</0> Upon account cancellation, your data remains accessible for export for 7 days. After 30 days, all Customer Data is permanently and irreversibly deleted from the primary PostgreSQL databases and all backups."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:68
msgid "<0>D. Technical/Usage Data:</0> IP addresses, browser type, and aggregate usage metrics (e.g., number of API calls, active integrations) to monitor system health and prevent abuse."
msgstr "<0>D. Technical/Usage Data:</0> IP addresses, browser type, and aggregate usage metrics (e.g., number of API calls, active integrations) to monitor system health and prevent abuse."

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:102
msgid "<0>Data Deletion:</0> Following cancellation, your workspace and all associated data will be permanently and cryptographically erased from our production PostgreSQL databases within 30 days. We do not retain your data to prevent you from returning."
msgstr "<0>Data Deletion:</0> Following cancellation, your workspace and all associated data will be permanently and cryptographically erased from our production PostgreSQL databases within 30 days. We do not retain your data to prevent you from returning."

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:95
msgid "<0>Data Export:</0> Upon cancellation, you have the right to export all your data to standard CSV and JSON formats."
msgstr "<0>Data Export:</0> Upon cancellation, you have the right to export all your data to standard CSV and JSON formats."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:304
msgid "<0>Data Portability:</0> You can export your data in machine‑readable CSV/JSON formats."
msgstr "<0>Data Portability:</0> You can export your data in machine‑readable CSV/JSON formats."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:178
msgid "<0>Future Phase 2:</0> We will migrate to managed Postgres (Neon/RDS) while maintaining the same strict isolation guarantees."
msgstr "<0>Future Phase 2:</0> We will migrate to managed Postgres (Neon/RDS) while maintaining the same strict isolation guarantees."

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:191
msgid "<0>No AI Training:</0> We strictly forbid the use of Customer Data to train machine learning models, Large Language Models (LLMs), or artificial intelligence systems. Your data is never used for our internal research and development. PII is redacted at compile time via redacting newtypes (Email, PhoneNumber) with Debug/Display as [REDACTED]; JSON serialization is strictly restricted to the API layer via wrapper structs."
msgstr "<0>No AI Training:</0> We strictly forbid the use of Customer Data to train machine learning models, Large Language Models (LLMs), or artificial intelligence systems. Your data is never used for our internal research and development. PII is redacted at compile time via redacting newtypes (Email, PhoneNumber) with Debug/Display as [REDACTED]; JSON serialization is strictly restricted to the API layer via wrapper structs."

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:67
msgid "<0>No Long-Term Contracts:</0> All subscriptions are month-to-month unless explicitly stated otherwise. We do not use 3-year lock-in clauses."
msgstr "<0>No Long-Term Contracts:</0> All subscriptions are month-to-month unless explicitly stated otherwise. We do not use 3-year lock-in clauses."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:207
msgid "<0>PII Anonymization:</0> In certain apps (like PAUSE/HR), GDPR anonymization routines (compiled table registry) automatically strip Personally Identifiable Information (PII) when records are deleted, replacing them with irreversible cryptographic hashes."
msgstr "<0>PII Anonymization:</0> In certain apps (like PAUSE/HR), GDPR anonymization routines (compiled table registry) automatically strip Personally Identifiable Information (PII) when records are deleted, replacing them with irreversible cryptographic hashes."

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:59
msgid "<0>Pricing is Fixed:</0> The price you agree to at checkout is the price you pay. We do not charge per-user fees. We do not charge per-task fees. We do not have hidden tiered pricing."
msgstr "<0>Pricing is Fixed:</0> The price you agree to at checkout is the price you pay. We do not charge per-user fees. We do not charge per-task fees. We do not have hidden tiered pricing."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:280
msgid "<0>Right to Access:</0> You can request a copy of your data (or just use the 1‑click export tool)."
msgstr "<0>Right to Access:</0> You can request a copy of your data (or just use the 1‑click export tool)."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:292
msgid "<0>Right to Erasure:</0> You can request immediate deletion of your data (or just use the 1‑click cancel button)."
msgstr "<0>Right to Erasure:</0> You can request immediate deletion of your data (or just use the 1‑click cancel button)."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:298
msgid "<0>Right to Object:</0> You can object to certain types of processing."
msgstr "<0>Right to Object:</0> You can object to certain types of processing."

#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:286
msgid "<0>Right to Rectification:</0> You can correct inaccurate data."
msgstr "<0>Right to Rectification:</0> You can correct inaccurate data."

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:203
msgid "<0>Status & RCAs:</0> We maintain a public status page. In the event of a P0/P1 outage, we will publish a technical Root Cause Analysis (RCA) within 24 hours of resolution."
msgstr "<0>Status & RCAs:</0> We maintain a public status page. In the event of a P0/P1 outage, we will publish a technical Root Cause Analysis (RCA) within 24 hours of resolution."

