#: src/app/privacy/page.tsx:96
msgid "<0>To Secure the System:</0> To monitor for unauthorized access, enforce tenant isolation, and prevent abuse of the platform."
msgstr "<0>To Secure the System:</0> To monitor for unauthorized access, enforce tenant isolation, and prevent abuse of the platform."

#: src/app/terms/page.tsx:167
msgid "<0>Your IP:</0> You retain all intellectual property rights to the data you input into Ataqu (deals, chats, docs, etc.). We are a data processor, not a data owner."
msgstr "<0>Your IP:</0> You retain all intellectual property rights to the data you input into Ataqu (deals, chats, docs, etc.). We are a data processor, not a data owner."

